@semivision_tw 市場暴跌後，我現在還勉強活著。

我從來沒想過 $LITE 被 $MRVL 收購後，股價竟然還能暴跌 -51.53%。

結果沒想到，連收購方 $MRVL 也一起崩了 -50.3%。

YARDENI: 

“.. Valuations are falling while earnings are soaring. We still view the AI backlash as another speed bump, not a roadblock. We are sticking with our 7,900 year-end target for the S&P 500.”

@yardeni

@elonmusk, why can’t we have both? I get why you want to build more Cybercabs. But the guy who’s finally willing to trade in his gas truck wants a truck he can own.

I’m seeing people who swore they’d never buy an EV driving Teslas now. For some of them, FSD is what changed their mind. I’d keep the Cybertruck alongside the Model 3 and Model Y and add three more models at prices that work for buyers and still leave Tesla a profit on each one.

That could help FSD, too. Every new owner who opts to share driving footage gives Tesla a chance to learn from situations its cars rarely see. Seems to me that giving people more Teslas to choose from could help you build a better Cybercab
